 "_": "Parallel-jaw robot gripper, v2: ISO 9409-1-50-4-M6 flange → NEMA 17 pancake stepper with an integrated Tr8×2 screw → flange nut in a carriage → cam yoke with two 45° slots → pins on two fingers under sliders on two Ø6 rails → replaceable pads outside the case. 88 × 71 × 104 mm case, pads to 126. Kinematic: the drive turns a hidden clock (one turn = one grip cycle); the screw angle \\`spin\\` swings 0 → 10 turns → 0, the nut follows by the lead (y = 54 closed … 74 open), and the fingers follow one to one: opening 0 → 40 mm. Press spin.",
